1
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:06,920
I like 'you', Mayama.

2
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:08,500
Why?

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,570
Because you're you.

4
00:00:11,890 --> 00:00:14,580
That's not an answer.

5
00:00:17,410 --> 00:00:22,180
<i>Why do I like him so much?</i>

6
00:00:23,210 --> 00:00:25,780
<i>I'm sure about one thing.</i>

7
00:00:28,610 --> 00:00:31,730
<i>Mayama is my first real crush.</i>

8
00:00:39,330 --> 00:00:41,770
Why do you want to go out with me?

9
00:00:41,770 --> 00:00:44,370
Because you're cool,

10
00:00:44,370 --> 00:00:46,790
and kind, too.

11
00:00:46,790 --> 00:00:49,220
I've never talked to you before.

12
00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:51,520
How would you know I'm kind?

13
00:00:56,720 --> 00:00:58,970
You should find someone else.

14
00:01:02,570 --> 00:01:07,440
<i>People always took one look at me,
and made assumptions.</i>

15
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:10,310
Another confession?
[Year 1, Class 4]

16
00:01:10,310 --> 00:01:12,150
How many is that now?

17
00:01:12,150 --> 00:01:14,460
More than what it was in middle school?

18
00:01:14,460 --> 00:01:16,700
Dunno. I haven't been keeping count.

19
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:19,360
- Dang.
- I'm jealous.

20
00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:21,060
Hey, uh...

21
00:01:21,060 --> 00:01:23,470
That's my seat.

22
00:01:23,470 --> 00:01:25,410
Oh, my bad.

23
00:01:27,860 --> 00:01:29,420
- Wanna be confessed to?
- I do.

24
00:01:29,420 --> 00:01:31,050
Just wait, we're only in our first year.

25
00:01:31,050 --> 00:01:33,980
Fair point. We'll have our opportunities.

26
00:01:33,980 --> 00:01:39,160
<i>At this point in time,
Mayama was just another classmate.</i>

27
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:44,330
Yikes. Why couldn't I be in the same class...

28
00:01:44,330 --> 00:01:49,070
Asamiya. I know you gotta dump them,
but be nice about it, yeah?

29
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:54,210
Sorry.

30
00:01:54,210 --> 00:01:56,660
<i>I took Sakaki's advice to heart.</i>

31
00:01:56,660 --> 00:01:59,220
<i>Even though these girls
were making assumptions,</i>

32
00:01:59,220 --> 00:02:03,030
<i>that was no reason to hurt their feelings.</i>

33
00:02:04,860 --> 00:02:07,510
I'm happy you feel that way.

34
00:02:07,510 --> 00:02:09,360
But, I...

35
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:13,220
No, I understand. Thank you for listening.

36
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:18,530
<i>I ignored my own discomfort,
and pretended to be nice.</i>

37
00:02:22,850 --> 00:02:25,320
- Let's go. Did you get it?
- Yup.

38
00:02:26,490 --> 00:02:28,900
Awesome!

39
00:02:32,920 --> 00:02:35,770
Asamiya! Come here.

40
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:29,310
<i>I'm happy you feel that way.</i>

41
00:03:29,310 --> 00:03:31,450
<i>But, I...</i>

42
00:03:31,450 --> 00:03:34,810
<i>No, I understand. Thank you for listening.</i>

43
00:03:37,860 --> 00:03:40,080
The hell?

44
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:43,100
[Oh my god, he's so hot!]
[I want a shot with him, too!]

45
00:03:43,100 --> 00:03:46,240
These comments are nasty.

46
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:48,190
Keep scrolling.

47
00:03:48,190 --> 00:03:51,130
Damn, this is awful.

48
00:03:51,130 --> 00:03:52,990
- Oh my god.
- There he is!

49
00:03:52,990 --> 00:03:57,330
Hello! We saw the video.
Can we get a selfie together?

50
00:03:58,120 --> 00:04:00,070
Why?

51
00:04:00,070 --> 00:04:01,180
Huh?

52
00:04:01,180 --> 00:04:04,190
To farm for likes on social media?

53
00:04:04,190 --> 00:04:06,970
Don't use me as engagement bait.

54
00:04:08,480 --> 00:04:11,090
My answer, is no.

55
00:04:11,090 --> 00:04:15,120
<i>No one thought about how I felt.</i>

56
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:18,320
He's nothing like he is in the video.

57
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:20,640
He's just a shallow guy with the looks.

58
00:04:20,640 --> 00:04:22,010
Yeah, seriously.

59
00:04:22,010 --> 00:04:24,910
<i>I was right to attend an all-boys school.</i>

60
00:04:24,910 --> 00:04:28,470
<i>At least I could be at peace here.</i>

61
00:04:28,470 --> 00:04:31,300
Asamiya could totally pull off a dress.

62
00:04:31,300 --> 00:04:34,150
If I posted a shot of that,

63
00:04:34,150 --> 00:04:36,170
I'd get crazy likes.

64
00:04:36,170 --> 00:04:37,560
- For sure.
- Hey!

65
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:39,310
- Let me get the likes!
- No way.

66
00:04:39,310 --> 00:04:40,740
Seriously?

67
00:04:40,740 --> 00:04:43,390
<i>You don't even know me.</i>

68
00:04:43,390 --> 00:04:46,210
Hey, you should ask him about it.

69
00:04:46,210 --> 00:04:51,320
I don't think Asamiya would appreciate that.

70
00:04:52,450 --> 00:04:54,520
Dude, just go along with it.

71
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:56,710
Asamiya's feelings matter.

72
00:04:56,710 --> 00:04:59,930
Uh, obviously we're not serious.

73
00:04:59,930 --> 00:05:01,670
Still...

74
00:05:02,870 --> 00:05:04,040
Whatever.

75
00:05:04,040 --> 00:05:06,220
You're such a killjoy.

76
00:05:17,570 --> 00:05:20,070
You put on the dress.

77
00:05:20,070 --> 00:05:21,660
Yes, sir.

78
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:40,920
I can't believe Sakaki had to join
the Clean-Up Committee.

79
00:05:44,810 --> 00:05:50,000
You two are waiting for Sakaki, right?

80
00:05:51,220 --> 00:05:54,670
- Yeah.
- A teacher's chewing him out right now.

81
00:05:54,670 --> 00:05:58,120
He was caught slacking,

82
00:05:58,120 --> 00:06:00,430
so he had to stay behind.

83
00:06:00,430 --> 00:06:01,600
I see.

84
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:04,840
Guess I'll go check on him.

85
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:11,740
<i>That was my first conversation with Mayama.</i>

86
00:06:13,060 --> 00:06:15,820
Huh? The daily log...

87
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:29,910
What're you doing?

88
00:06:29,910 --> 00:06:32,610
The daily log wasn't filled in yet.

89
00:06:35,460 --> 00:06:37,450
The person on duty must've forgot.

90
00:06:37,450 --> 00:06:40,110
It's not your job to fill it in.

91
00:06:40,110 --> 00:06:42,640
But I found it blank.

92
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:46,600
So, you'll fill it in for them?

93
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:49,410
I'm sure they didn't forget on purpose.

94
00:06:49,410 --> 00:06:52,180
Hopefully they won't get in trouble
for the small mistake.

95
00:06:56,110 --> 00:06:59,810
Why'd you defend me the other day?

96
00:07:00,660 --> 00:07:02,170
Huh?

97
00:07:03,410 --> 00:07:07,470
The other dudes wanted me to crossdress.

98
00:07:08,200 --> 00:07:12,540
Defending me wasn't doing you any favors.

99
00:07:16,980 --> 00:07:20,410
Sure, but it's more important
to respect how you feel.

100
00:07:25,180 --> 00:07:28,170
If they were egging me on like that,

101
00:07:28,170 --> 00:07:30,500
I certainly wouldn't like it.

102
00:07:30,500 --> 00:07:33,960
So I figured you wouldn't, either.

103
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:37,810
But I was just making assumptions.

104
00:07:37,810 --> 00:07:41,250
Besides, I don't really care
if they come to dislike me.

105
00:07:51,520 --> 00:07:53,500
Asamiya?

106
00:07:54,770 --> 00:07:56,700
Ignore me.

107
00:08:06,670 --> 00:08:12,180
<i>Mayama's kind words mended by broken heart.</i>

108
00:08:13,520 --> 00:08:15,750
<i>That conversation was the catalyst.</i>

109
00:08:17,660 --> 00:08:19,630
Great throw!

110
00:08:19,630 --> 00:08:22,640
<i>I would find myself looking at him from afar.</i>

111
00:08:24,650 --> 00:08:27,890
Hey, you dropped this.

112
00:08:27,890 --> 00:08:29,700
Thanks.

113
00:08:29,700 --> 00:08:32,730
<i>At first, watching him was enough for me.</i>

114
00:08:32,730 --> 00:08:35,850
I needed the extra hand. Thank you.

115
00:08:35,850 --> 00:08:37,460
You're welcome.

116
00:08:41,890 --> 00:08:43,230
<i>But as time passed...</i>

117
00:08:43,230 --> 00:08:46,810
Mayama.

118
00:08:46,810 --> 00:08:48,420
I've got bread right here.

119
00:08:49,750 --> 00:08:51,380
I'll take this one.

120
00:08:51,380 --> 00:08:52,450
That'll be 120 yen.

121
00:08:52,450 --> 00:08:56,410
<i>I found Mayama's awkward kindness, endearing.</i>

122
00:08:58,450 --> 00:09:00,810
<i>I wanted to get closer to him.</i>

123
00:09:02,540 --> 00:09:04,850
<i>I wanted to touch him.</i>

124
00:09:07,800 --> 00:09:09,820
<i>I wanted to hug him.</i>

125
00:09:30,010 --> 00:09:32,820
<i>I wanted to make him all mine.</i>

126
00:09:32,820 --> 00:09:35,880
<i>My admiration quickly changed
to something else entirely.</i>

127
00:09:37,580 --> 00:09:40,840
<i>It didn't take long for me to realize</i>

128
00:09:41,700 --> 00:09:44,570
<i>what I felt for him now, was "love".</i>

129
00:09:49,850 --> 00:09:53,780
<i>If I conveyed these feelings of mine...</i>

130
00:09:54,770 --> 00:09:58,470
<i>I knew they'd only trouble Mayama.</i>

131
00:10:01,740 --> 00:10:03,520
<i>Yet, as fate would have it,</i>

132
00:10:04,680 --> 00:10:07,630
<i>we were once again placed in the same class.</i>

133
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:12,130
<i>And with him sitting right in front of me...</i>

134
00:10:13,690 --> 00:10:16,260
[I like you.]

135
00:10:18,990 --> 00:10:21,710
<i>I couldn't hold myself back any longer.</i>

136
00:10:31,150 --> 00:10:32,650
Huh?

137
00:10:38,520 --> 00:10:43,520
<i>I thought I knew I'd only be troubling him.</i>

138
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:14,460
<i>There are better people out there for you.</i>

139
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:21,330
Why did I say that?

140
00:11:46,390 --> 00:11:47,580
This konjac jelly,

141
00:11:47,580 --> 00:11:48,980
right by the entrance.

142
00:11:48,980 --> 00:11:51,310
- Isn't it a bit much?
- Probably.

143
00:11:51,310 --> 00:11:53,690
Let's take it out, and...

144
00:11:54,380 --> 00:11:57,950
<i>Time continued to pass,</i>

145
00:11:57,950 --> 00:12:00,360
<i>as I remained unable to talk to Asamiya.</i>

146
00:12:00,360 --> 00:12:02,170
They won't expect it.

147
00:12:02,170 --> 00:12:04,120
Yeah.

148
00:12:06,350 --> 00:12:08,140
What about the exit?

149
00:12:08,140 --> 00:12:10,680
Should we add more?

150
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:13,490
- No.
- Please, Komori?

151
00:12:13,490 --> 00:12:16,320
We won't make it in time for the festival.

152
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:20,070
I still can't allow you
to stay on campus overnight.

153
00:12:20,070 --> 00:12:23,910
And that's "Ms." Komori to you.

154
00:12:27,670 --> 00:12:30,360
But, Komori...

155
00:12:31,980 --> 00:12:34,870
Now what do we do?

156
00:12:34,870 --> 00:12:36,610
Pull an all-nighter at somebody's place?

157
00:12:36,610 --> 00:12:39,760
Mine's off limits.
My sister's studying for exams.

158
00:12:39,760 --> 00:12:43,140
Same, my five siblings would bother us.

159
00:12:43,140 --> 00:12:45,520
What about your place, Asamiya?

160
00:12:45,520 --> 00:12:47,280
I remember it looking big,

161
00:12:47,280 --> 00:12:49,230
not that I've ever been inside.

162
00:12:53,180 --> 00:12:55,280
If none of your places work...

163
00:13:01,510 --> 00:13:02,960
Pretty spacious, Mayama.

164
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:06,070
Yeah, this is perfect.

165
00:13:06,070 --> 00:13:07,680
Great.

166
00:13:07,680 --> 00:13:09,680
I didn't realize you lived so far, though.

167
00:13:09,680 --> 00:13:11,890
Why'd you pick our school?

168
00:13:11,890 --> 00:13:13,690
I had my reasons...

169
00:13:13,690 --> 00:13:15,640
Here's some tea and snacks for you all.

170
00:13:15,640 --> 00:13:16,780
- Thanks.
- Thank you.

171
00:13:16,780 --> 00:13:20,510
Of course. I'm happy to have
Hare's friends over.

172
00:13:20,510 --> 00:13:22,390
Good luck on the festival prep.

173
00:13:24,200 --> 00:13:27,830
- All right, let's get to it.
- Yeah.

174
00:13:27,830 --> 00:13:30,110
I'm ready to work all night.

175
00:13:30,110 --> 00:13:33,510
Same here.

176
00:13:36,230 --> 00:13:39,210
- 'Sup!
- Dude.

177
00:13:39,210 --> 00:13:40,860
Not the time.

178
00:13:40,860 --> 00:13:43,090
Get to work.

179
00:13:43,090 --> 00:13:45,870
Practice tomorrow.

180
00:13:45,870 --> 00:13:46,880
- Aw, no practice?
- Not now.

181
00:13:46,880 --> 00:13:48,740
We're here to crunch work.

182
00:13:48,740 --> 00:13:50,610
Right.

183
00:13:51,410 --> 00:13:53,060
I'm sweating.

184
00:13:53,060 --> 00:13:54,990
This mask is stuffy.

185
00:13:54,990 --> 00:13:57,130
"Need a guide"?

186
00:13:57,790 --> 00:14:00,080
Dude, work.

187
00:14:15,780 --> 00:14:18,050
I'm awake.

188
00:14:24,930 --> 00:14:27,430
I'll go get us refreshments.

189
00:14:28,140 --> 00:14:29,970
I'll join you.

190
00:14:48,410 --> 00:14:50,380
I'm sorry we imposed.

191
00:14:50,380 --> 00:14:52,030
Huh?

192
00:14:52,030 --> 00:14:54,950
We all invited ourselves over, day of.

193
00:14:55,860 --> 00:14:58,350
It's fine.

194
00:14:58,350 --> 00:15:02,170
My room's never been that lively before.

195
00:15:02,170 --> 00:15:06,250
I'm glad the space could help out.

196
00:15:08,160 --> 00:15:11,350
You never change, do you?

197
00:15:12,180 --> 00:15:17,360
I want our haunted house to be a success.

198
00:15:19,370 --> 00:15:24,460
I've never worked in a group
with friends before.

199
00:15:26,040 --> 00:15:28,350
In middle school...

200
00:15:31,170 --> 00:15:34,430
my friends often made fun of me.

201
00:15:36,500 --> 00:15:41,130
One time, they pulled this prank on me.

202
00:15:43,390 --> 00:15:49,170
They said a girl in our class liked me.

203
00:15:49,170 --> 00:15:51,950
That she wanted to confess.

204
00:15:53,910 --> 00:15:57,180
So, during a summer festival,

205
00:15:58,110 --> 00:16:01,390
I tried to politely turn her down.

206
00:16:02,450 --> 00:16:04,510
But...

207
00:16:05,200 --> 00:16:08,220
<i>She didn't know what I was talking about.</i>

208
00:16:08,900 --> 00:16:11,740
Dude, obviously we were joking.

209
00:16:11,740 --> 00:16:13,740
<i>My friends all came to laugh at me.</i>

210
00:16:13,740 --> 00:16:16,080
She'd never confess to a guy like you.

211
00:16:16,080 --> 00:16:17,960
Exactly.

212
00:16:17,960 --> 00:16:21,070
<i>I realized then it was all a joke.</i>

213
00:16:27,620 --> 00:16:30,840
Anyone would be hurt after that.

214
00:16:34,100 --> 00:16:38,130
They used you for their own entertainment.

215
00:16:40,320 --> 00:16:42,370
That's nothing a friend would do.

216
00:16:47,110 --> 00:16:52,770
Asamiya. I'm happy you told me how you felt.

217
00:16:53,680 --> 00:16:56,130
And I want to believe you, I really do.

218
00:17:01,290 --> 00:17:03,990
But I can't help it. I'm still scared.

219
00:17:07,800 --> 00:17:09,550
So, could you wait?

220
00:17:11,190 --> 00:17:13,980
Just a bit longer, until I'm ready to answer?

221
00:17:20,160 --> 00:17:22,340
I'll wait as long as you need me to.

222
00:17:24,420 --> 00:17:27,390
And don't feel forced to answer, either.

223
00:17:55,880 --> 00:17:57,760
We're back.

224
00:18:15,070 --> 00:18:17,090
Ouch.

225
00:18:17,090 --> 00:18:18,950
You okay?

226
00:18:18,950 --> 00:18:20,460
Yeah, I just pricked myself.

227
00:18:20,460 --> 00:18:22,790
I'll lick it clean.

228
00:18:25,990 --> 00:18:28,350
You have to get that properly patched up.

229
00:18:34,270 --> 00:18:37,100
[Bandage]

230
00:18:48,400 --> 00:18:50,710
Sorry.

231
00:18:50,710 --> 00:18:52,020
Huh?

232
00:18:52,020 --> 00:18:54,130
I kept saying I liked you,

233
00:18:54,130 --> 00:18:58,520
without even considering how you felt.

234
00:18:58,520 --> 00:19:01,420
I made you feel horrible.

235
00:19:01,420 --> 00:19:04,340
- No, I...
- Mayama.

236
00:19:04,340 --> 00:19:07,120
You're always considerate
of my feelings, but I...

237
00:19:08,090 --> 00:19:09,800
Asamiya.

238
00:19:09,800 --> 00:19:12,630
You never made me feel bad.

239
00:19:13,990 --> 00:19:16,400
It's just...

240
00:19:17,470 --> 00:19:22,040
I don't know how I should treat you anymore.

241
00:19:23,270 --> 00:19:26,140
- Just...
- Act normal, right?

242
00:19:26,140 --> 00:19:27,890
I know.

243
00:19:28,760 --> 00:19:30,710
I know that.

244
00:19:32,480 --> 00:19:34,160
Still...

245
00:19:41,760 --> 00:19:43,310
Let's do this.

246
00:20:07,750 --> 00:20:09,350
Mayama?

247
00:20:10,650 --> 00:20:12,980
Sorry.

248
00:20:12,980 --> 00:20:15,430
Feel free to take a nap.

249
00:20:15,430 --> 00:20:17,210
I'll be fine.

250
00:20:17,210 --> 00:20:21,240
It's probably because I'm relieved.

251
00:20:22,420 --> 00:20:26,050
I'm glad we finally made up.

252
00:20:28,320 --> 00:20:30,450
You're too cute.

253
00:20:34,280 --> 00:20:36,380
When you have a break during the festival,

254
00:20:38,050 --> 00:20:41,150
do you want to check out
the other set-ups together?

255
00:20:45,620 --> 00:20:48,060
Yeah. I want to eat crepes.

256
00:20:48,990 --> 00:20:50,730
Sounds good.

257
00:20:50,730 --> 00:20:52,920
Let's grab some takoyaki, too.

258
00:20:52,920 --> 00:20:54,930
What else...

259
00:21:00,040 --> 00:21:01,840
Mayama?

260
00:22:37,420 --> 00:22:41,200
[Kitahara High Culture Festival]

261
00:22:41,200 --> 00:22:42,630
Looking good.

262
00:22:42,630 --> 00:22:45,190
- Thanks for helping.
- Sure.

263
00:22:45,190 --> 00:22:47,180
Seriously, it looks great.

264
00:22:55,970 --> 00:22:57,820
[Tenn Mayama (Esteemed brother)]

265
00:23:01,540 --> 00:23:03,410
Hello?

266
00:23:03,410 --> 00:23:04,780
<i>Asamiya?</i>

267
00:23:04,780 --> 00:23:05,910
Good morning.

268
00:23:05,910 --> 00:23:10,140
<i>I'm sorry, Hare can't make it
to the festival today.</i>

269
00:23:10,140 --> 00:23:11,610
Huh?

270
00:24:39,860 --> 00:24:41,130
I want to push through.

271
00:24:41,130 --> 00:24:42,940
We all worked so hard on this.

272
00:24:42,940 --> 00:24:44,530
Victory!

273
00:24:44,530 --> 00:24:46,180
I think I'm ready

274
00:24:46,180 --> 00:24:48,780
to give Asamiya my answer.

275
00:24:48,780 --> 00:24:51,140
Let me stay like this.

276
00:24:51,140 --> 00:24:54,100
I won't be able to stop myself.

